# Thulium · Tm · gate 69

**Thulium** (Tm) is element **69** of the periodic table — a **lanthanide**, period 6, group f-block, f-block, solid at standard conditions, atomic weight **168.93**.

## The element (carbon layer — reference chemistry)
Rarest of the stable rare earths; a portable X-ray source.

